her file in the tree spelling it is a finding page\'s prose. The other four name `claude-account`, which is a real page type at `agents/claude-accounts/claude-account.page-type.ts:56`, so those four are wrong only in the key. Four assertions certify the wrong key: `upkeep-capacity.readout.test.ts:11`, `attribute-charisma.readout.test.ts:27`, `upkeep-safety.readout.test.ts:55` and `:96`, each expecting `"session-tracking"`. Meanwhile four `.module.code.ts` files in the same package spell `pageTypeSlug` correctly — `readout-scale-reading:22`, `readout-none-left:27`, `readout-serving:76`, `readout-group-serving:58` and `:113` — so both dialects sit side by side in one workspace package.\n\nWHAT I DID NOT ESTABLISH. I did not run the seven surviving queries against the index, so I have not shown those refuse — only that they carry the same `page-type` key that made `upkeep-surplus` refuse. I did not judge whether the repairs in flight intend to reach them. I did not measure how many other test files in the repository assert a value straight back off the object under test.',
